      "content": "Thanks for this. It’s a good start, but looking at the analyzer, the score is coming back a bit low. It’s basically a 4/10 on the luxury scale. \n\nI know I said not to overdo it, but we really need this to feel more \"distinguished\" to attract the right crowd. Can you try another version? Try to really lean into that high-end, elite feeling. Just please make sure the 8,500 sq ft and the bed/bath count stay in there so the specs are still accurate.",
